{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，妳醒了嗎？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不在啊。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近，跟櫻乃說話的機會減少了。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然跟美羽學姊相處的時間變多，但是不能因此就失去兄妹間的交流。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她先出門了嗎……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知從什麼時候開始，我已經習慣一個人上學了。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要去社團教室就能遇到人。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要去社團教室就能見到美羽學姊。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，為什麼呢？", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "習慣這件事的自己有些許的寂寞。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早安，學姊。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……早安，新吾君。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1789", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊站在兔子小屋前，好像在找什麼東西的樣子。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我在找小熊喵……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1790", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，熊喵的話我昨天早上有在社團看到牠。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸，真的嗎？太好了，牠沒事……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1791", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然臉上帶著微笑，但學姊雙手交握在胸前，有點寂寞的樣子。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳還沒給牠嗎？尾巴的新飾品……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。而且現在變得這麼冷，好擔心牠晚上有沒有問題。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1792", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們不在的時候，熊喵都在做什麼呢？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1793", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連在圖鑑上都沒有看過，生態成謎的生物。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只知道算是貓科的吧，大概……", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……學姊，會冷嗎嗎？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到學姊呼出白色的氣息，我就想握住她的手。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直接抱住還有點不好意思就是了。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，這樣會很溫暖喔。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1794", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……學姊主動抱住了我。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "令人安心的氣味。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為身高差距，所以學姊踮起腳尖靠在我身上。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這樣抱著她轉圈試試好了？啊哈哈、唔呼呼呼……像在花田裡一樣。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉喔，突然抱住你。」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1795", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係，只是有點嚇一跳而已。沒想到學姊會這麼做……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我這樣不行吧。因為年紀比你大，所以要忍耐才對。」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1796", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是在學校的時候，一直在忍耐。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是嗎？」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1797", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然了。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太好了……我好害怕。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1798", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「害怕？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為新吾君最近都好冷靜，我想說你是不是對我膩了……之類的。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1799", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不對不對不對不對！」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我全力否定。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天不是也說過了嗎？我最喜歡美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1800", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不相信我嗎？」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，不是那樣的。但是，好像變得貪心了……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1801", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的臉頰浮現紅暈。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光是說喜歡新吾君，好像已經不夠了♪」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1802", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管嘴巴上說了多少喜歡，翻湧的情緒還是停不下來。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以才會牽手、擁抱、親吻。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們沉默下來，親吻對方。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想一整天都跟學姊在一起。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊，我也一起找熊喵……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1476", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔欸，新吾來了啊。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1477", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是現實沒有那麼美好。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早安，紗凪。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哼嗯。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1478", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼？怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有啊。美羽學姊，我們去那邊找吧？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1479", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯，說的也是。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "mu1803", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她很明顯就是要把學姊從我身邊搶走。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是真心祝福我們的嗎……", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶，你跟美羽學姊真的在交往嗎？」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1480", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「突然問這個？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "下課時間，紗凪把我叫來走廊，然後沒有任何鋪陳就問了。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「至少我是覺得有交往啦。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你應該沒有妄想症之類的吧？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1481", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳覺得我是一個擅自妄想跟學姊交往的神經病？」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我又沒有說到那種程度。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1482", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是有些人光是對上視線就以為對方喜歡自己不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1483", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比如在夏天穿著長大衣裡面全裸的男人之類的。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1484", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那種人應該非常罕見吧。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我搞不懂紗凪到底想說什麼。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……這該不會是……」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1485", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳到底怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1486", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「幹嘛一直盯著我……」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或許不行了吧。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1487", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蛤？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一般來說，情侶是更甜甜蜜蜜，不分場合就卿卿我我的才對吧？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1488", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「路上也能常常看到在親親的情侶呢。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1489", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，是有看過。」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但今天早上的美羽學姊是怎麼回事？那麼冷靜，跟平常一樣嘛。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1490", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不是戀愛中的女人的表情。真的在談戀愛的話，胸口應該要更揪緊才對。」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1491", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光是跟喜歡的男人四目相對，就會想一整天都把他監禁在房間裡為所欲為。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1492", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那種戀愛也太糟糕了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且還是被女孩子做到那種程度。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是不是包容力不夠啊？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1493", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「包容力？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果是情侶，一般來說要更迷戀才對吧。」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1494", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我覺得很迷戀了啊。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不對，學姊沒有迷戀。」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1495", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果她真的喜歡新吾，就算在我面前應該也會跟你卿卿我我才對。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1496", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊會顧慮別人的眼光啊。而且她也不是會在大家面前那樣做的個性。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我～就～說～了，能把那些顧慮都破壞殆盡沉迷其中的才叫做戀愛啊。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1497", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為什麼我要被她教導什麼是戀愛啊？", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……雖然如果學姊能變成那樣是很厲害啦。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這表示還能把美羽學姊搶回來嗎……？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1498", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不不，那不可能。」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「誰知道呢？好男人是能用眼神就殺死一個女人的呢～」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1499", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用眼神……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "拿紗凪來練習看看。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瞪她就可以吧？瞪她。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔！？」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1500", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂！你不准殺我啦！」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 313, "voice": "sn1501", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
